# Variants tried before this one (same box, same day)
- Cilium defaults (iptables masquerade): agent fatal 'error while creating ipset cilium_node_set_v4' (needs ip_set).
- kubeProxyReplacement=true + bpf.masquerade, k3s kube-proxy disabled: agent ran and policy was enforced by pod IP, but ClusterIP services failed (CoreDNS could not reach the API server).
- Extra check on the passing variant: pod HTTPS to api.openai.com/v1/models returned 401 (reachable, no key sent).
